            "kind": "NO_CODE_CHANGE",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 15,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Rohit PAI ",
                        "email": "rohitpai77@gmail.com",
                        "username": "rohitpai"
                    },
                    "message": "Is it allowed now to set MinPasswordLength to zero ? Is that acceptable ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 15,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Chandra Harkude",
                        "email": "Chandramohan.harkude@gmail.com",
                        "username": "chandramohan83"
                    },
                    "message": "Not allowed any value less than pre-configured value in pwquality.conf"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 25,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Rohit PAI ",
                        "email": "rohitpai77@gmail.com",
                        "username": "rohitpai"
                    },
                    "message": "why we need a macro if we are already reading this from conf file."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 25,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Chandra Harkude",
                        "email": "Chandramohan.harkude@gmail.com",
                        "username": "chandramohan83"
                    },
                    "message": "This MACRO helps in setting default value, if read is failed for config file then default value can be used"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meson.options",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Rohit PAI ",
                        "email": "rohitpai77@gmail.com",
                        "username": "rohitpai"
                    },
                    "message": "why only MIN Password length \n\nwhat about below properties \n{\n  \"MaxPasswordLength\": 20,\n  \"AccountLockoutThreshold\": 5,\n  \"AccountLockoutDuration\": 300,\n  \"AccountLockoutCounterResetAfter\": 60,\n  \"AuthFailureLoggingThreshold\": 10,\n  \"ServiceEnabled\": true\n}"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meson.options",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Chandra Harkude",
                        "email": "Chandramohan.harkude@gmail.com",
                        "username": "chandramohan83"
                    },
                    "message": "I am starting with minimum password length and wanted understand the feed back later I will raise for remaining."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meson.options",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Chinmay Shripad Hegde",
                        "email": "hosmanechinmay@gmail.com",
                        "username": "chinmay-hegde"
                    },
                    "message": "As per new NIST guideline password should be min of 15 chars.\n\nhttps://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b.html#passwordver"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meson.options",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ravi Teja",
                        "email": "raviteja28031990@gmail.com",
                        "username": "raviteja-b"
                    },
                    "message": "looks like minimum of 15 chars is recommendation not requirement.\n\nMinimum required (SHALL): 8 char\n\nRecommended minimum (SHOULD): 15 char"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meson.options",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Chinmay Shripad Hegde",
                        "email": "hosmanechinmay@gmail.com",
                        "username": "chinmay-hegde"
                    },
                    "message": "Ack, i think we can keep 8 chars to avoid any existing scripts/code which might be using password with specific lengths.\n\nBut we can mention the recommendation of NIST in description. So that if some platform wants to use recommended values they can override."
                }
            ],
